### Application Service Tests - Using Nginx Reverse Proxy
### These tests use the nginx reverse proxy routes (port 80) instead of direct service ports

@baseUrl = http://localhost/api

### Test Application Service health endpoint (direct - not through API Gateway)
GET http://localhost:4001/health

### 1. Create Internship Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "application_type": "internship",
  "internship_data": {
    "company": "TechCorp Inc.",
    "position": "Software Developer Intern",
    "duration_months": 6,
    "start_date": "2025-07-01",
    "supervisor_name": "John Smith",
    "supervisor_email": "john.smith@techcorp.com",
    "description": "Full-stack development internship focusing on React and Node.js",
    "requirements": "Knowledge of JavaScript, Git, and basic database concepts"
  }
}

### 2. Create Incubation Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "application_type": "incubation",
  "incubation_data": {
    "project_name": "EcoTrack App",
    "business_model": "Freemium SaaS model with premium features",
    "target_market": "Environmentally conscious consumers and small businesses",
    "funding_amount": 50000.00,
    "team_size": 3,
    "project_stage": "MVP Development",
    "description": "Mobile app for tracking personal carbon footprint and sustainability goals"
  }
}

### 3. Create PFE Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "application_type": "pfe",
  "pfe_data": {
    "title": "Machine Learning for Medical Diagnosis",
    "supervisor_name": "Dr. Sarah Johnson",
    "company": "MedTech Solutions",
    "academic_year": "2024-2025",
    "specialization": "Computer Science - AI",
    "objectives": "Develop and evaluate ML models for early disease detection using medical imaging",
    "methodology": "Supervised learning using CNNs on medical image datasets",
    "expected_outcomes": "Achieve 95% accuracy in disease classification with deployed model"
  }
}

### 4. Get all applications for authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 5. Get specific application by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/APPLICATION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Update application status (admin/encadrant only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/applications/APPLICATION_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "approuvee",
  "feedback": "Application approved. Please proceed with next steps."
}

### 7. Query applications with filters (admin/encadrant only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/query?status=en_attente&application_type=internship&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
